; Incenter rabbit ear on the flat square, ear folded to the c side: the three
; angle bisectors of triangle abc meet at the incenter; flat-foldability
; forces the emergent hinge as the perpendicular from the incenter to a
; triangle side — to --ab for (toward .a), to --bc for (toward .c). The two
; realizations mirror across the b–d line (a symmetry axis of the square), so
; both must exist; the c-side one requires seating the fold on a sector the
; CCW enumeration labels orientation-reversing (anchor-parity fallback).
; `.t = --ear * --bc` doubles as the side discriminator: the a-side ear line
; is PARALLEL to --bc, so this meet errors if the wrong side is picked.

paper square

mark (through .a .c) as --diag
mark (map --ab onto --diag) as --ea
mark (map --ab onto --bc) as --eb
mark (map --bc onto --diag) as --ec

; Leading pair is (--ea .a)(--ec .c): their <180 arc is the big stayer
; sector the ear folds onto; the emergent splits it into the two mirror
; worlds (toward) then picks (design 2026-07-17 stayer convention).
flatten (--ea) (--ec) (--eb) (toward .c) as --ear
.t = --ear * --bc

; assert --ear is mountain
